{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26208","headline":"奉送刘使君王屋山隐居 · 殷尧藩","name":"奉送刘使君王屋山隐居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"散发风檐下，沈沈日渐曛。\n鹰拳擒野雀，蛛网猎飞蚊。\n羣动能归计，吾生亦谩勤。\n尘缘难着眼，晚兴寄青云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26208.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26208","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}